  "description": "Yeon-Hee, a righteous police officer, struggled with a working mother and raised her son Do-Yeon alone. Do-Yeon, who is 20 years old, grew up to be a 'normal child' with a good heart like her mother's wish. But the dark shadows of serial killings begin to fall on the lives of two happy people. Will Yeon-Hee welcome \"it\" as a mother, who is tightening herself and her son? Will he fight back with the police? \n\n(Naver, translated)",
